<title>EGYPT: EGYPT POUND O/V RATE WIDE, WEEKLY DOWN.</title>
<headline>EGYPT POUND O/V RATE WIDE, WEEKLY DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound widened on Tuesday amid a short private sector market to between 8-7/8 and 9-3/8 percent from Monday's range of nine and 9-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>Average one-week rates fell to between 8-7/8 and 9-1/2 precent from nine and 9-1/2 percent on Monday.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
